{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 3D Platformer Where Every Jump Tests Your Sanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search For Paradisus</strong> is an adventure that blends the agility and classic exploration of 3D platformers with a deep narrative and a Dark Fantasy universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a mere spark of your former self, trapped in <i>Purgatorium</i>, a dark labyrinth existing outside of time and space. The answers about your past are a blur lost in your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c27e264d3388938d326f4e57ebd8e5b9.poster.avif?t=1771621423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c27e264d3388938d326f4e57ebd8e5b9.webm?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c27e264d3388938d326f4e57ebd8e5b9.mp4?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sarcastic Guide and False Hope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only company emerges from the flames of a tree that burns without being consumed. This enigmatic being, who calls himself <strong>Mr. Nobody</strong>, offers help with a constant air of disdain. He points the way to <i>Paradisus</i>, your only chance at freedom. His intentions, however, are a mystery as dark as your own prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Mr. Nobody's slightly questionable help, your journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c6db9e3180406717cd94e7ca72e7a828.poster.avif?t=1771621423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c6db9e3180406717cd94e7ca72e7a828.webm?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/c6db9e3180406717cd94e7ca72e7a828.mp4?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features (Refined Edition):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the definitive, fully recreated version of the original experience, delivering the game in its most polished and complete form:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Fluid 3D Platforming:</strong> Programming and controls have been rebuilt from the ground up. Master precise jumps and overcome treacherous obstacles with a fast and responsive character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Explore the Labyrinth:</strong> Lose yourself in artistically enhanced Dark Fantasy levels, discover hidden secrets, and collect <i>Hopes</i> \u2013 essential fragments to forge your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>The Web of Mr. Nobody:</strong> Confront the enigmatic nature of your guide and find echoes of other lost souls. An immersive narrative with new cutscenes that question truth and trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Your Fate, Your Choices:</strong> Expanded content featuring <strong>3 different endings</strong>. The truth about your past awaits in Paradisus. What will you become to reach it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.poster.avif?t=1771621423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.webm?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.mp4?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Mr. Nobody\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/f5a89a08f77feda9053a40a830364f43cbe8eebc.jpg"},{"name":"First Area Cleared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/5a5b7968eb61f47013a9c80c1f057d8e2c47e573.jpg"},{"name":"Losing Sanity!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/f749fb3be43e746da4f857d02a815b9b937462cf.jpg"},{"name":"My Precious!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/474f17195fd49995163050cef03090d9b9ab65d7.jpg"},{"name":"Any Similarity Is...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/cb44a6cca26e54725306b9682ef13fdbef4aabd4.jpg"},{"name":"More Careful!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/da6b54680af62df775d3be5198a128a7c00d441d.jpg"},{"name":"I Hate Mazes!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/dd73ece99b9ed4a25f59dfc51476a5220fe8b8b3.jpg"},{"name":"Is This Hell?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/692de5b0179ef5192d58199bb5d7ceabe09c01ae.jpg"},{"name":"It's On Fire, Man!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/6efc5a7220ba73f41ebdeae0d96c379f99d08704.jpg"},{"name":"I've Seen Worse Hells!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176000/7fc2df240da14ea74cdd8540c929852e8c75b206.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2176000?t=1771621423","background_r