tial fragments to forge your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>The Web of Mr. Nobody:</strong> Confront the enigmatic nature of your guide and find echoes of other lost souls. An immersive narrative with new cutscenes that question truth and trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Your Fate, Your Choices:</strong> Expanded content featuring <strong>3 different endings</strong>. The truth about your past awaits in Paradisus. What will you become to reach it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.poster.avif?t=1771621423\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.webm?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/extras/8284ff79d38f638d0b1a4497b466ca89.mp4?t=1771621423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Walter O. M. Junior"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176000/a4c772ba2b1e701391aae229846e73c70e95b53e/header.jpg?t=1771621423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2176000/1783207059/6dc553ba2ddb2abefde5f2f179b1763be8f7a0c0/1760570309/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760737494","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2176000/1783207059/6dc553ba2ddb2abefde5f2f179b1763be8f7a0c0/1760570309/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760737494","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2176000/1783207059/6dc553ba2ddb2abefde5f2f179b1763be8f7a